    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the true harp of Kereseira.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The priestess of Endymion reaches out her hand to brush away a corner of the fence running around the burdenbeast pasture, pulling out a few overgrown blades of grass, revealing a harp built into the fence itself."
    },
    {
        "text": "The simple instrument has nearly become one with the pasture. Not far away, the burdenbeasts leisurely munch on the radishes the priestess had brought along, humming in satisfaction."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Its coloration has darkened, the paint on the base is mottled, and while the decorative elements are still there, their surfaces have burdenbeast bite and hoof-polishing marks. The whole thing looks like an ornament in the corner of the field.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I shouldn't question you... but this... I find it rather hard to believe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are a specialist in your field, and no doubt have a repertoire of techniques and standards to confirm it. You may examine it in detail.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you say so. The wood used for the harp's body is definitely from the firs that grow near the site of old Athenius. As for its design, it's simpler than the one I brought.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "The strings are far too new, though. These are metal strings, only popularized in the last few years...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The original strings snapped a long time ago. I replaced them recently.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "I had also tried using traditional beastgut strings, but... No matter the type, the result was always the same.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "Legend has it that the day Old Athenius fell, Kereseira's harp fell silent, never to sound again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "Metal, beastgut, once a month I would come here to try and play it, but I could never make it sing again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...However you put it, it's the harp Kereseira used\u2014",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Assuming what you say is true...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Sargonians aren't occupying Minos anymore. Why keep it hidden in a field?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why, when I suggested holding the ceremony at the First Temple, no, even before that, when the Astynomos agreed to conduct the exchange for this relic\u2014You're a priestess, you must have known.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why didn't you bring it out earlier?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A harp that doesn't sing is merely a beautiful piece of wood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "It can be a fence in a field, or a toy for the burdenbeasts, but what it cannot be... is the centerpiece around which to gather everyone together for a ceremony celebrating the completion of a temple.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "This makes no sense. Even the fake we brought plays notes that move the soul.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Which is why it is merely a fake. As for the harp before us, if you don't believe me, try it for yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You may touch it. No need for reverence. I understand your hesitation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you can make it sing... If you can create a miracle, then you may consider it the harp you brought along, and use it to complete your trade.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "I make you this promise, as the current keeper of the harp.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... Sorry, but I've got one more question: why me? Sure, I need the real harp, but the First Temple also needs it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am a priestess of Endymion Temple, Kyr\u00eda Mashayer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "We are the hierophants of revelation. For the people, we interpret dreams, decipher visions, and divine the future.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sometimes, we will offer some comforts of our own accord, but most times, we will be passive, deferring to established facts and heroic wills.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "Words flow from my lips, but they are beyond my control. Like how the things appearing before my eyes are not necessarily a pleasure to see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "We might call coincidence fate, but when true fate approaches, all our witticisms and pontification lose their meaning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do I have the power to allow the sun to shine, the rivers to flow, to dictate all from high to low?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "You carry the harp of Kereseira\u2014counterfeit though it may be\u2014and it has appeared in Athenius. This can only be an omen. The events of the past few days stand as proof.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But what is most important is your character. It is because it is you, and not your fellow countryman, that I expect your spirit to resonate with the harp.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "First, try singing heroic odes to it. Try playing it. Give your heart to it, and speak to it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, perhaps, you really will be able to make it sing, and bring about a miracle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
