    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's finally gone... All that mysterious claptrap, sheesh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cloakmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What, ready to play already? You really believe her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "She is a priestess of Minos, and Pallas's friend. I doubt she'd lie to me about this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Also... If we really can bring the real harp to the ceremony at the First Temple... It'll sure beat running all over Terra with a fake harp strapped to my back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "It doesn't really matter if this is the 'true fate' the priests speak of, or if it's some kind of test from the Minoan people, but I have to give it a try.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And how're you going to do that? All that 'give your heart to it', 'bring about a miracle' baloney, what's your methodology here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's start by playing it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
