    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_meowlong",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Holy shit, that sounds terrible!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "effect",
        "name": "$e_emoji_matter",
        "layer": 1,
        "x": 250,
        "y": 150
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not good. No matter what I try, it only makes these dull sounds.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is the harp's structure damaged? But this kind of hand-held harp doesn't have a sound box... The issue is probably elsewhere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've already tried adjusting the tension of the strings, but no effect. Could it be a problem with some delicate internal component? But I don't have any tools to take it apart, inspect it, and reassemble it right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What a pain in the ass.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm thinking we go back to stealing the fake harp. Worst comes to worst, I'll help you steal it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stealing it doesn't mean having to traipse around Terra... Well, we can still do that if you want. We could go to your Pepe girl for some funding.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "But now that the real harp is right in front of me, making that choice now would be like running away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pfah. We can call it a tactical relocation, if you prefer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ever since I was little... The heroes in the tales my father told me, they never ran away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
