        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1491_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1490_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.7,
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just my bad luck, having to take part in this worthless funeral.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Impatient Noble"
    },
    {
        "text": "A useless idiot who squandered every chance the Padishah gave him. This mongrel destroyed our family's reputation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Impatient Noble"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1491_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.7,
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, not in front of the girl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flippant Noble"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1490_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.7,
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What does it matter? I said all that to the man himself! All he did was smile. Didn't even have the courage to talk back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Impatient Noble"
    },
    {
        "text": "Couldn't fight worth a damn, had zero skill in managing the family estates. He said he could appraise things, but he couldn't tell good gems from bad. All he ever did was buy a pile of ancient Minoan books. Who knows if that was even worth anything?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Impatient Noble"
    },
    {
        "text": "All he did was think about useless things like that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Impatient Noble"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1491_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.7,
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe he had the sort of romantic soul the poets sing of.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flippant Noble"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1490_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.7,
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Romantic? Save it. Would you rather have romance or jewels?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Impatient Noble"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1491_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.7,
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're asking me? It's not like I'm a poet myself. To me, a giant jewel is an expression of romance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flippant Noble"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "focusout",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "type": "bg",
        "from": 0,
        "to": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The day my father was buried, the nobles of the city spoke ill of him in front of me and my mother."
    },
    {
        "text": "Mother said we were an ancient Sargonian family, and that we had to maintain perfect decorum, so all I could do was maintain an appropriate expression on my face."
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew what they said may have been right, because he was a people-pleaser through and through, someone who amounted to absolutely nothing."
    },
    {
        "text": "But I... still didn't want to hear them judge him as they pleased."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
