    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The heroes of the Minoan tales my father told me were brave, never shirking from their duties.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "They would meet all sorts of obstacles on their journey, but they were always determined, forever confronting the challenges they had to confront.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never really knew why... My father, he was... a weak man. Why did he love these stories...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "This passion of his, why did it never change him, or how he treated people? I simply don't understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look, don't shoot the messenger here, but maybe some puny humans yearn for the things they don't have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Maybe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I've always remembered how clear and steady his voice was as he told me these stories.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I love those stories too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those heroes... Gentle, strong, resolute... Always walking their own paths. That's how I imagine them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "There must be some greater... purpose, or ideal, otherwise I don't know what meaning there is in life...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "'A hero must face fate bravely when it comes, and carry their own burden.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
