    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Father's stories... always had lines like that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cloakmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Those tales... Siopi... the hero who... suffered in silence... keeping her secrets... Kereseira... Heraces...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I need to think of a way...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
