    {
        "text": "Falling asleep after all that yammering. She didn't even wake me up. Pfeh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems the little girlie needs her beauty sleep too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, what's with the crying?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're always all about that stiff upper lip, always saying you won't cry, and now you're letting me catch you in the act? I need to keep some evidence for later.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Terminal... Photo mode... How the hell do you use this thing?",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, press here. Hee-hee!",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$skill_flash",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*... Nothing interesting about a crying girl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll help you out, you crybaby. Call it payback for the free meals these past few days.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "You wanted a miracle, right? Easy as proverbial pie!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
